  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types | devDependencies | patch | `0.4.20` -> `0.4.23` | [source](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types</summary>\n\n### [`v0.4.23`](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.23)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.22...v0.4.23)\n\n-   safer type checking ([#&#8203;179](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/179)) [@&#8203;tquetano-netflix](https://togithub.com/tquetano-netflix)\n\n### [`v0.4.22`](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.22)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.21...v0.4.22)\n\n-   Add support for custom createReactClass function name ([#&#8203;177](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/177)) [@&#8203;tquetano-netflix](https://togithub.com/tquetano-netflix)\n-   Add handling for removing propTypes from babel output code ([#&#8203;163](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/163)) [@&#8203;gandazgul](https://togithub.com/gandazgul)\n\n### [`v0.4.21`](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.21)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.20...v0.4.21)\n\n-   Add support for defining additionalLibraries as a regexp expression ([#&#8203;174](https://togithub.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/174)) [@&#8203;pkuczynski](https://togithub.com/pkuczynski)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
